* We will assemble a team with the necessary skills and expertise, including AI development, business analysis, and training.
* We will work closely with our consortium partners, such as EuroCloud Solutions S.A. or LexIA GmbH, to leverage their expertise in areas like sovereign cloud hosting or legal AI.
* We will ensure that our solution is hosted within the European Union, using infrastructure that meets the necessary security and regulatory requirements.

Given our available PM capacity of 60% as of 2024, we can start the project on March 1, 2025. Our team will work closely with the client to ensure that the annual cost of exploitation remains compatible with their budgetary capacities.
